1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:03,670
(Raj:)I don't know. I lost track
and I missed my exit.

2
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:05,437
(Raj:)So, uh... so what's up?

3
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:06,735
(Claire:)Well, last time we talked,

4
00:00:06,736 --> 00:00:09,706
(Claire:)I had just gotten back together
with my boyfriend,

5
00:00:09,706 --> 00:00:12,506
(Claire:)and I wanted to let you know
that things didn't work out.

6
00:00:12,509 --> 00:00:13,909
(Raj:)Really? I'm sorry.

7
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,180
(Raj:)I swear I know other words.

8
00:00:16,179 --> 00:00:18,509
(Claire:)So if you were
still interested...

9
00:00:18,515 --> 00:00:20,985
Yes! Indeed!
Absolutely! Indubitably!

10
00:00:20,984 --> 00:00:22,814
(Raj:)I'm not even sure
what the last one means,

11
00:00:22,819 --> 00:00:24,919
(Raj:)but it's another word,
and I know it.

12
00:00:24,921 --> 00:00:26,421
(Raj:)So, uh,

13
00:00:26,423 --> 00:00:27,893
(Raj:)when do you want to meet up?

14
00:00:27,891 --> 00:00:29,591
(Claire:)Uh, I'm almost off work.

15
00:00:29,592 --> 00:00:30,792
(Claire:)What are you doing now?

16
00:00:30,794 --> 00:00:32,694
R-Right now, well...

17
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,126
(Raj:)Well, actually,
to-to be completely honest,

18
00:00:35,131 --> 00:00:36,861
(Raj:)I'm stopping by
to see my ex-girlfriend

19
00:00:36,866 --> 00:00:38,636
(Raj:)because she's having
a tough time. But...

20
00:00:38,635 --> 00:00:40,565
(Raj:)it's not like we're getting
back together or anything.

21
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:43,300
(Claire:)Let me guess, the worst part
about breaking up

22
00:00:43,306 --> 00:00:46,446
(Claire:)is that she doesn't have her
best friend to talk to anymore?

23
00:00:46,443 --> 00:00:47,943
That's exactly what she said!

24
00:00:47,944 --> 00:00:49,374
(Raj:)How do you know that?

25
00:00:49,379 --> 00:00:52,409
(Claire:)I'm a girl. It's, like,
page one out of the playbook.

26
00:00:52,415 --> 00:00:55,755
(Raj:)Any chance you could send me
a PDF of that playbook?

27
00:00:58,288 --> 00:00:59,658
(Leonard:)They've been out
there a while.

28
00:00:59,656 --> 00:01:01,256
(Amy:)I hope
everything's okay.

